  "sourceTitle": "Pistachio Frosting",
  "sourceText": "Pistachio Frosting\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 3:22am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 envs whipped topping mix\n1 pkt (small) instant pistacho pudding mix\ncup Cold milk\ncup Chopped nuts\ncup Coconut\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Beat whipped topping mix with the milk. Add pudding mix and beat for 2 minutes. Fold in nuts and coconut. Spread on cooled Pistachio Cake. Keep refrigerated.",
